 Wozniak had an idea: What if you combined computer circuitry with a regular typewriter keyboard and a video screen? The result was the first true personal computer, the Apple I. Widely affordable and easily understood, Wozniak's invention has been rapidly transforming our world ever since. His life--before and after Apple--is a \"home-brew\" mix of brilliant discovery and adventure, as an engineer, a concert promoter, a fifth-grade teacher, a philanthropist, and an irrepressible prankster. From the invention of the first personal computer to the rise of Apple as an industry giant, iWoz presents a no-holds-barred, rollicking, firsthand account of the humanist inventor who ignited the computer revolution.--From publisher description","edition_name":"1st ed.","genres":["Biography"],"source_records":["marc:marc_openlibraries_phillipsacademy/PANO_FOR_IA_05072019.mrc:43649792:1403","ia:iwozcomputergeek00wozn_093","marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run03.mrc:161865949:3540","bwb:9780393061437","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part33.utf8:120326019:2145","ia:iwozcomputergeek0000wozn","marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-012.mrc:220603263:2865","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/ab.bib.10.20150123.full.mrc:73121314:2038","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_016.bib.mrc:179626698:4838"],"title":"iWoz","languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Wozniak, Steve, -- 1950-","Apple Computer, Inc. -- History","Computer engineers -- United States -- Biography","Inventors -- United States -- Biography","Computer industry -- United States -- History"],"publish_country":"nyu","by_statement":"Steve Wozniak with Gina Smith.","oclc_numbers":["70668758"],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"publishers":["W.W. Norton & Co."],"ia_box_id":["IA122324"],"key":"/books/OL17205556M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL5231936A","name":"Steve Wozniak"}],"publish_places":["New York"],"pagination":"313 p., [16] p. of plates :","classifications":{